        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>frequency_compensation</name>
        <qualifiedname>sl_bt_evt_cs_result_s::frequency_compensation</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Frequency compensation value. Units: 0.01 ppm (15-bit signed integer).<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><bold>Range:</bold> -100ppm (227680) to +100ppm (10000)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Value: 0xC000. Frequency compensation value is not available or the role is not initiator. This is reported only in the first subevent in the procedure. For subsequent subevents, this value is set to 0. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
