        <name>procedure_done_status</name>
        <qualifiedname>sl_bt_evt_cs_result_s::procedure_done_status</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Enum <ref refid="group__sl__bt__cs_1ga7eb16c89a888196a9c82fb85feb8d5a3" kindref="member">sl_bt_cs_done_status_t</ref>. Current status of the CS procedure Values:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><bold>sl_bt_cs_done_status_complete (0x0):</bold> All results complete for the CS procedure or subevent</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>sl_bt_cs_done_status_partial_results_continue (0x1):</bold> Partial results with more to follow</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><bold>sl_bt_cs_done_status_aborted (0xf):</bold> Current procedure and all subsequent subevents in the procedure aborted or current subevent aborted. </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
